WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:06.512
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:06.513 --> 00:00:09.688
What do they see?

3
00:00:09.689 --> 00:00:17.309
They see a ball.

4
00:00:17.310 --> 00:00:27.548
The blobs run to the ball.

5
00:00:27.549 --> 00:00:40.575
They poke the ball.

6
00:00:40.576 --> 00:00:58.215
They roll the ball.

7
00:00:58.216 --> 00:01:21.353
They throw the ball.

8
00:01:21.354 --> 00:01:37.906
They catch the ball.

9
00:01:37.907 --> 00:01:52.434
They hit the ball.

10
00:01:52.435 --> 00:02:05.494
They kick the ball.

11
00:02:05.495 --> 00:02:14.783
Oh no! The ball goes far!

12
00:02:14.784 --> 00:02:21.293
Here is a new ball. Yay!

13
00:02:21.294 --> 00:02:23.500
Silly blobs!

14
00:02:23.501 --> 00:02:26.943
Good-bye!

